abstract: >
  An integrated aviation-grade accountability architecture for AI systems and
  agentic workflows. The stack includes the AI Black Box Standard (AIBB), Loop
  Detector, ZeroTX Architecture, Persistent Identity Layer (PIL), Missing CVR,
  Ethics Floor, AI Preflight Briefing Standard, AI Type Rating Framework, Chief
  AI Accountability Officer role, Distributed Oversight Model, Early Warning
  Channel, ZeroTX Deployment Tiers, and Check-Ride Protocol. Together these
  standards define a modular system for AI audit trails, drift detection,
  human-AI oversight, data sovereignty, operator accountability, enterprise AI
  governance, and regulatory readiness in consequential domains including
  healthcare, law, finance, insurance, government, and enterprise decision
  support.
